          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.55.120:block:1",
          "start": 563
        },
        "quote": "(b) Upon the failure of any business to fully and timely pay the taxes due as may be required or to provide reports or other information requested by the City and reasonably necessary for the implementation of this chapter, the City shall either revoke or not renew the authorization of such an exemption. (Ord. 18477 § 19, 7-12-05; Ord. 18365 § 6, 12-21-04; Ord. 17270 § 12, 6-2-98; Ord. 16349 § 12, 7-23-91. Code 1981 § 42-42. Code 1995 § 138-87.)",
